# Actual

The recorded result of an time estimate. Added when the work is done, which completes the estimate.

◇

attributes:
    - key: value
      name: Value
      details: Value recorded when the estimated work is complete.
      rules: "[0 .. unconstrained] at 1 unit"
      type_spec: Nat
    - key: completion_time
      name: Completion Time
      details: When the work was completed.
      rules: datetime
      type_spec: Nat
